foreign  welcome to another installment of Harry  Potter Theory today we're going to be  discussing new secret details recently  released regarding the upcoming Harry  Potter game Hogwarts Legacy on September  30th the Hogwarts Legacy Twitter tweeted  the following it's time to bend the  rules and learn some tips not included  in your Field Guide here's an  unauthorized guide to Student Life at  Hogwarts hashtag Hogwarts Legacy and  while many fans at first taught this  guide was some sort of secret guide  perhaps written by a Hogwarts student  in-game it turns out that was wrong pink  Ravenclaw tweeted wait is the  unauthorized guide the field guide or  are those two distinct books to which  Avalanche software Community manager  Chandler wood responded the unauthorized  guide is our fun social spin on things a  fun way to show you a variety of things  around Hogwarts via arms social channels  the field guide is in game with more  details about it yet to be revealed the  regular Field Guide differs from the  unauthorized Field Guide in that it is  an actual usable item within Hogwarts  Legacy whereas the unauthorized version  is simply a bit of social media fun but  for now let's jump back to the  unauthorized Field Guide where  developers have released a number of  secret tips related to the game hidden  Within These tips are many previously  unknown tidbits about the game that fans  should be pleasantly surprised by tip  number one common room secrets Hogwarts  is full of secrets the common rooms are  no exception there's also faded looking  handwriting which seems to say something  to the effect of take staircase to  Kitchen go down hallway third Barrel  this is of course in reference to the  entrance of the Hufflepuff common room  which we've already seen in the common  room tour videos also released by  developers tip 2 Restricted Section of  the library restricted is just a  suggestion but don't get caught  The Faded handwriting on this page reads  bring flowers to garlic or maybe Garrick  make sure they're not wilted I'm not  entirely sure what this one is trying to  communicate but I'd imagine it could be  something to do with Sebastian salo's  storyline and his family curse it could  also be something related to the  Hogwarts librarian tip 3 defense against  the dark arts classroom the classroom  was made for Mischief like meddling with  Professor hackett's hebridian black  skeleton skeleton is circled here for  some reason the faded handwriting on  this page appears to show four spells  including petrificus totalus the full  body bind curse Rick December the  tickling charm ridiculous a Bogut  counter charm and Superfly a stunning  spell four more spells that we now know  will appear in game tip 4 peeves avoid  peeves at all costs The Faded  handwriting on this page says ask about  sharps or a badge this is of course a  reference to Hogwarts Legacy potions  Professor sharp I guess he's an exorer  if you didn't know auras are essentially  law enforcement workers for the ministry  of magic tip 5 secret crossed ones and  just before what appears to be dueling  Club is written everything gets crossed  out for some reason whatever it means  this does confirm that the game will  have a dueling club which is great news  for all tip 6 zonko's joke shop zonkos  is your One-Stop shop for causing Mayhem  and Mischief what this confirms is that  players will be able to visit zonko's  joke shop where they can purchase  materials to prank other students  sometimes you just have to think to  yourself what would Fred and George Do  The Faded enigmatic looking handwriting  on this page says cauldron cakes batter  is moist good to trade with fizzing  wisbees very sweet pepperimps strong  peppermints lets you breathe fire if you  don't remember Ron Weasley discusses  fizzing whispies in the Goblet of Fire  where he describes them as massive  sherbet balls that make you levitate a  few inches off of the ground it's also  worth noting that Albus Dumbledore used  fizzing wisby as the password to his  office in December 1995. tip 7 Forbidden  Forest sneak off in the Forbidden Forest  and live to tell the tale what this  confirms is that players will be able to  access the mysterious Forbidden Forest  located on the Hogwarts grounds The  Faded enigmatic looking handwriting on  this page says mooncalf instructions  brush once a day feed Moon cough a day  with something don't forget playtime  this is likely a reference to the  player's ability to raise different  animals in game this feature will allow  players to channel their inner Newt  commander and to take care of all sorts  of interesting magical creatures and  that's it for now stay tuned for more  Hogwarts Legacy videos and other videos  and be on the lookout for Hogwarts  Legacy giveaway in the near future if  you don't want to miss it be sure to  subscribe until next time remember it  does not do to dwell on dreams and  forget to live  [Music]

